<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="eyebrow">How privacy is approached</div>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="copy">
    <p>Vera Health Notes is currently presented as a public informational website. It does not currently provide visitor accounts or an on-site registration form.</p>
    <p>Website delivery and security may involve technical information processed by our infrastructure provider, Cloudflare, according to its applicable practices.</p>
    <p>If analytics, advertising, newsletter subscriptions, or additional tracking technologies are introduced, this policy will need to be reviewed and updated to accurately describe them.</p>
    <p>Do not submit sensitive medical or financial information through this website.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to homepage</a>
</Layout>
